    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dustward - Survive the post-apocalyptic ruins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the devastated world, fight mutants, build fortifications, and develop your character in the dynamic survival-action Dustward. Play solo or team up with friends (up to 4 players) in co-op mode to face the dangers of the dead world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging campaign and 4-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive character progression system and unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building and trap placement capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, hunting, and comprehensive survival mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful dialogues and interesting quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and unpredictable danger zones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustward is your personal survival story in a ruthless post-apocalyptic world. Can you endure this nightmare?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dustward - Survive the post-apocalyptic ruins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the devastated world, fight mutants, build fortifications, and develop your character in the dynamic survival-action Dustward. Play solo or team up with friends (up to 4 players) in co-op mode to face the dangers of the dead world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging campaign and 4-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive character progression system and unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building and trap placement capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, hunting, and comprehensive survival mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful dialogues and interesting quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and unpredictable danger zones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustward is your personal survival story in a ruthless post-apocalyptic world. Can you endure this nightmare?</p>",
